{"title": "Waking Mind", "pageid": 21595, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Waking_Mind", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Icon.png/300px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/a/ad/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Waking Mind image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Icon.png/300px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Waking Mind</b> is a unique item found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A humanoid brain - alive and in perfect condition - suspended in cerebrospinal fluid.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 5 kg (10 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 5 kg (10 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony#Necrotic_laboratory\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Necrotic Laboratory</a> inside the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a> after solving the brain mapping puzzle</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Speaking to the head can grant the permanent buff <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githzerai_Mind_Barrier_(Condition)\" title=\"Githzerai Mind Barrier (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Githzerai Mind Barrier\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Githzerai_Mind_Barrier_(Condition)\" title=\"Githzerai Mind Barrier (Condition)\">Githzerai Mind Barrier</a>. The player character must choose either <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Persuasion\" title=\"Illithid Persuasion\">Illithid Persuasion</a> dialogue option (consume / purge her mind) to receive this buff.</li>\n<li>When placed on the Mind-Archive Interface within the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Slack-Skinned_Head\" title=\"Slack-Skinned Head\">Slack-Skinned Head</a> speaks:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>HmmMM... fine bones... sharp jaw... some variety of elf?</li>\n<li>Pretty enough for a flesh-prison - if not the noble githzerai features I was born with.</li>\n<li>I'd guess you're no willing guest of the <i>ghaik</i> either. Perhaps we might aid one another.</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"History Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/History\" title=\"History\">History</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>: *The monk-like githzerai, sibling-race to the warrior githyanki. Their contempt for one another is eclipsed only by their shared hatred of the illithids.*</li>\n<li>Reply: How did you end up in that vault? Githzerai are supposed to be ultimate warriors.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Warriors of the <i>mind</i>. Oh, there's some physical prowess involved, but the battlefield on which we truly fight the <i>ghaik</i> is their own.</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Reply: <span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[GITHYANKI]&nbsp;</span></span>Why? This form fits you so much better, cousin.</span></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Well, a githyanki skull would be too tight a fit, <i>cousin</i>. Your people shunned psionics, after all - while mine mastered them.</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Reply: <span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[GITHYANKI]&nbsp;</span></span>How did you end up in that vault? Aren't you <i>zerai</i> ultimate warriors?</span></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Warriors of the <i>mind</i>, cousin. A discipline unknown to your kind - and the very reason we were attacked.</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Reply: You called yourself <i>githzerai</i>. Is that some kind of githyanki?</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Oh, for a set of hands to slap your face. The <i>yanki</i> lost their way the moment Gith threw down the <i>Ghaik</i> empire.</li>\n<li>Only we <i>zerai</i> continue the war to end the <i>ghaik</i> forever. Only <i>we</i> fight them on their own battlefield - the mind.</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Reply: You're remarkably sane for a pickled brain.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>A githzerai's mind is not so easily cracked. Our discipline was the very reason we were attacked.</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Reply: I'm not interested.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Only because I haven't told you how you will benefit.</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Reply: I'm listening. What aid are you offering?</li>\n<li>My order taught a psionic technique much-feared by the <i>ghaik</i>. They destroyed us for it, and kept me as a trophy.</li>\n<li>I never broke, but... I've spent all these centuries awake. <i>Aware.</i> So here is my offer:</li>\n<li>Use your tadpole. Erase me - and I will pass my technique onto you.</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;18 Insight Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;18 <a href=\"/wiki/Insight\" title=\"Insight\">Insight</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>: *You catch the lie - the monk isn't telling everything.*</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Alternatively, if playing as a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Class_Warlock_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Warlock_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Class_Warlock_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Warlock_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Class_Warlock_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Warlock_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warlock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Class_Warlock_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Warlock_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Class_Warlock_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a><i>: *A prickling flame runs across the back of your mind and the edge of your soul. Your patron bids you caution before agreeing to this pact. The monk isn't telling you everything.*</i></li>\n<li>Reply: If you want my help, then tell me the truth.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>...All right. I... the <i>ghaik</i> did not find my monastery. <i>I led them there.</i></li>\n<li>They promised me immortality. And they gave it - I have been their rotting trophy for <i>centuries</i>.</li>\n<li>*As her agitation swells, so does her latent psionic power. To your tadpole, that guilt and terror are almost... <i>fragrant</i>.*</li>\n<li>*You realise the illithids locked her away not as a trophy, but as a fine vintage.*</li>\n<li><i>Please</i> - touch my mind, and purge it. The moment you do, my knowledge will be yours.</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Reply: You want me to kill you. What if I can free you instead?</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>My people dwell in Limbo - a realm of pure, chaotic thought. With my mind gone, perhaps my soul will return there.</li>\n<li>Or perhaps not. Death, freedom - they are one and the same.</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Reply: I'll do it.</li>\n<li>Touch my mind, and <i>purge</i> it - at the very moment you do, I will make my knowledge yours.</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Reply: When you say 'erase' your mind - do you by any chance mean 'smash your brain to bits'?</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>...I do not. The <i>ghaik</i> have been warping flesh for millennia - who knows what damage they can undo.</li>\n<li>It is my mind they enslave. It is my mind that must die.</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><i>Reach out and erase/purge her mind.</i></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>*The awareness that floods you is nothing like the tadpole. It is tentative, and tingled with the loneliness of aeons.*</li>\n<li>*It fades beneath your touch, but you feel something left behind. A fragment.*</li>\n<li>It's only knowledge yet, without comprehension. But when you use it, you will... see...</li>\n<li>And I... I see...</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><ul><li><i>Reach out and consume her mind.</i></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>Thank you, I - wait.</li>\n<li>No. NO. PLEASE!</li></ul></dd></dl></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195143\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1799/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25699/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14228/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 925456/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.949      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.949      1 -total\n 35.51%   14.898      8 Template:Icon_text\n 27.44%   11.510     17 Template:Trim\n 15.20%    6.375      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.44%    5.217      1 Template:Cond\n 12.35%    5.179      2 Template:Icon_link\n 11.48%    4.815      2 Template:Ability_check\n 11.22%    4.705      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.04%    4.633      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3